From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Retain the embedded session, headset and input interfaces

Rebase the previous 22 embedding patches on FreeRDP 8cbbd9f5275f.
Keep upstream reconnect, keyboard and pure-move coalescing. The upstream
API-24 compatibility work supersedes the previous parcel/window patches.
The individual original changes remain in this integration's git history.

